      "text": "Many people nowadays have decided to stop flying or to limit the amount of\ntimes they use this form of transport. This will undoubtedly have great benefits\nfor the environment, but it may mean that for individuals or businesses this\ncan translate to higher expenses. I believe the disadvantages for individuals\nand businesses would be greater than the effects on the environment. This\nessay will discuss advantages and disadvantages of this.\n"
